{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DKPFZXjez9GMGkZctDw8j6","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tTop-K CSS Faithfulness — Final Gate Data\n2\t\n3\t== Arithmetic ==\n4\t| Circuit | k | Edges | Zero CPR | Mean CPR |\n5\t|---------|---|-------|----------|----------|\n6\t| CSS=1.0 | 50 | 44 | -0.2411 | 0.9186 |\n7\t| CSS>=2/3 | 50 | 83 | -0.1756 | 0.9577 |\n8\t| ACDC | 50 | 50 | -0.2335 | 0.9073 |\n9\t| EAP-IG | 50 | 50 | -0.0900 | 0.9853 |\n10\t| EP | 50 | 50 | -0.0934 | 0.9619 |\n11\t| CSS=1.0 | 75 | 54 | -0.2411 | 0.9186 |\n12\t| EAP-IG | 75 | 75 | -0.0433 | 0.9959 |\n13\t\n14\tCondition④: CSS=1.0 < EAP-IG → FAIL\n15\t\n16\t== IOI ==\n17\t| Circuit | k | Edges | Zero CPR | Mean CPR |\n18\t|---------|---|-------|----------|----------|\n19\t| CSS=1.0 | 50 | 14 | 0.1087 | 0.1803 |\n20\t| ACDC | 50 | 50 | 0.0088 | 0.1987 |\n21\t| EAP-IG | 50 | 50 | 0.0905 | 0.1794 |\n22\t| EP | 50 | 50 | -0.0182 | 0.1902 |\n23\t| CSS=1.0 | 100 | 24 | 0.1099 | 0.1760 |\n24\t| EAP-IG | 100 | 100 | -0.1092 | 0.1003 |\n25\t\n26\tCondition④ IOI: CSS=1.0 (14e) CPR≥EAP-IG (50e) → PASS (edge-efficient)\n27\t\n28\tIOI CPR inconsistency: RESOLVED — different tasks compared, not a data reliability issue."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_017BjPSE6L4fSghmZkphTcJ8","session_id":"ffd92ab4-c587-4272-8b8a-d75b465e4752","uuid":"2d51bcf7-372e-4816-b65b-0a57d11832d4","timestamp":"2026-05-13T06:22:17.589Z"}
